t makeover services this side of the Milky Way!** \n \nBusted ecosystem? Barren atmosphere? Too darn hot to breathe? Come on up and let us save your planet!\n\n{1114697741052232}\n\nTerry's Terraforming is fixing up planets across the galaxy, and **YOU** are exactly who we're looking for.\n\nUsing your hands (and **Terry\u2019s finest gadgets**), you\u2019ll warm climates, grow forests and gently nudge planets into shapes their quirky residents can thrive in. \n\nEach species wants something different, so you\u2019ll have to **experiment, observe, and learn what each world truly needs.**\n\n{1406030007814188}\n\nAnd along the way, uncover an out-of-this-world story about what it really takes to grow shareholder value in the wilds of outer space.\n\n{1113264131241702}\n\nThere's always more to do!\nCompete in daily leaderboards and challenge other Terry's employees with your own creations.", "short_description": "Come on up to Terry's Terraforming, the friendliest planet makeover service in the Milky Way. Fix up faraway worlds, meet the aliens who live there, and make yourself at home among the stars."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.really-interactive.se/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Really Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.really-interactive.se/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "sup